(6174800, 911102, 99263, '<td valign="top">Nicely seen landscape and those silhouetted trees against the light reflected in the dust cloud thrown up from the plough is really dramatic. Very nice but the thick black border on top and below distracts. I think a thin plain black border would have been more effective. 7</td>', 'Nicely seen landscape and those silhouetted trees against the light reflected in the dust cloud thrown up from the plough is really dramatic. Very nice but the thick black border on top and below distracts. I think a thin plain black border would have been more effective. 7', '2010-09-29 12:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6174803, 911415, 99263, '<td valign="top">I like this for the unusual close up angle and the muted light. Very mood evoking. Reminds me of a painting I once saw somewhere I think. 7</td>', 'I like this for the unusual close up angle and the muted light. Very mood evoking. Reminds me of a painting I once saw somewhere I think. 7', '2010-09-29 12:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
