(6175352, 911860, 69246, '<td valign="top">Interesting. You must have taken this near dusk and used a longer shutter. At first, I thought "wow no shadows". Then, I noticed the star trails. So, after seeing those star trails, it really put this photo into a different perspective. Is there a town or city over the hill on the right or is the the sun? I like this!</td>', 'Interesting. You must have taken this near dusk and used a longer shutter. At first, I thought "wow no shadows". Then, I noticed the star trails. So, after seeing those star trails, it really put this photo into a different perspective. Is there a town or city over the hill on the right or is the the sun? I like this!', '2010-09-29 23:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
