(6175749, 911696, 96751, '<td valign="top">What a great scene!  I noticed the chickens first because they are close and colorful, then the cool fence.  Then - surprise! - the windmill at the end.  Toto, we''re not in Kansas anymore!</td>', 'What a great scene!  I noticed the chickens first because they are close and colorful, then the cool fence.  Then - surprise! - the windmill at the end.  Toto, we''re not in Kansas anymore!', '2010-09-30 11:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6175756, 911023, 96751, '<td valign="top">Actually, it looks like they''re just watching OTHER horses working... :-)</td>', 'Actually, it looks like they''re just watching OTHER horses working... :-)', '2010-09-30 11:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6175759, 911523, 96751, '<td valign="top">Though more of a landscape than a depiction of country life, this is so far my favorite.  Love the fog on the distant mountains.</td>', 'Though more of a landscape than a depiction of country life, this is so far my favorite.  Love the fog on the distant mountains.', '2010-09-30 11:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6175763, 910951, 96751, '<td valign="top">For me, this image is just short of really good.  The composition and colors are very pleasing, and the reflection is interesting.  But it just lack that "pop", easily accomplished here with just a bit more contrast, levels adjustment, and/or saturation.</td>', 'For me, this image is just short of really good.  The composition and colors are very pleasing, and the reflection is interesting.  But it just lack that "pop", easily accomplished here with just a bit more contrast, levels adjustment, and/or saturation.', '2010-09-30 11:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6175765, 911427, 96751, '<td valign="top">Quite an awesome view, although the whole image looks oversharpened to me.</td>', 'Quite an awesome view, although the whole image looks oversharpened to me.', '2010-09-30 11:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6175766, 911012, 96751, '<td valign="top">SO Veronica Lake!  This horsie must know you to let you get that close.</td>', 'SO Veronica Lake!  This horsie must know you to let you get that close.', '2010-09-30 11:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6175769, 911746, 96751, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge.  I''m all about the pov, and I think a sharper angle might have given this image a stronger dynamic.  Also, a bit stronger on the sepia would also have strengthened to mood.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge.  I''m all about the pov, and I think a sharper angle might have given this image a stronger dynamic.  Also, a bit stronger on the sepia would also have strengthened to mood.', '2010-09-30 11:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6175770, 911733, 96751, '<td valign="top">Ah, to be a sunflower farmer.  Surprisingly effective in b/w.  The swayed horizon works well, and the lighting on the trees and clouds in fabulous.  Great image, though technically more landscape than "country life".</td>', 'Ah, to be a sunflower farmer.  Surprisingly effective in b/w.  The swayed horizon works well, and the lighting on the trees and clouds in fabulous.  Great image, though technically more landscape than "country life".', '2010-09-30 11:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6175771, 911334, 96751, '<td valign="top">Was there something to the right of this great scarecrow?  Or was he behind a fence you couldn''t trespass?  Otherwise, I''m not sure I understand this angle, since there is clearly a glorious forest turning colors on the right and just that really unattractive bush occupying a third of the image on the left.</td>', 'Was there something to the right of this great scarecrow?  Or was he behind a fence you couldn''t trespass?  Otherwise, I''m not sure I understand this angle, since there is clearly a glorious forest turning colors on the right and just that really unattractive bush occupying a third of the image on the left.', '2010-09-30 12:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6175773, 911835, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting here, and the rays inside the box through the slats is a gorgeous detail.  I feel that cropping out everything right of the right tree would have really improved the composition, and focused more on the scene between the crates and the apples.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting here, and the rays inside the box through the slats is a gorgeous detail.  I feel that cropping out everything right of the right tree would have really improved the composition, and focused more on the scene between the crates and the apples.', '2010-09-30 12:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6175776, 911186, 96751, '<td valign="top">For me this is a case of a really great scene taken from too far away.  Compositionally, this image is all about the foreground - a vast expanse of gray gravel that takes up almost one half of the entire image.  It even takes up more room than the sky, which is far more interesting. We can barely see most of the interesting things that say "country", such as the tractor and the cows.  And the horizontal lines of the fence are mostly invisible.  Perhaps cropping this harshly, from the left to the first cow, and from the bottom to just below the stone wall shadow would help, but getting closer would have been better :-)</td>', 'For me this is a case of a really great scene taken from too far away.  Compositionally, this image is all about the foreground - a vast expanse of gray gravel that takes up almost one half of the entire image.  It even takes up more room than the sky, which is far more interesting. We can barely see most of the interesting things that say "country", such as the tractor and the cows.  And the horizontal lines of the fence are mostly invisible.  Perhaps cropping this harshly, from the left to the first cow, and from the bottom to just below the stone wall shadow would help, but getting closer would have been better :-)', '2010-09-30 12:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6175780, 911073, 96751, '<td valign="top">One of teh very few (actually the first I''ve seen so far) images that depict "country life" <i>artistically</i>!  Glorious colors, and that lighting!!  Oh my.  I adore contre jour, and it has lit up the horse''s whiskers, tail, and breath, and the man''s sleeve, to fabulous effect.  There is a real relationship here, not only between the man and horse, but between them and their surroundings, and to the dawn of day.  Such warmth and depth.  Thank you for this gorgeous capture.</td>', 'One of teh very few (actually the first I''ve seen so far) images that depict "country life" artistically!  Glorious colors, and that lighting!!  Oh my.  I adore contre jour, and it has lit up the horse''s whiskers, tail, and breath, and the man''s sleeve, to fabulous effect.  There is a real relationship here, not only between the man and horse, but between them and their surroundings, and to the dawn of day.  Such warmth and depth.  Thank you for this gorgeous capture.', '2010-09-30 12:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6175782, 911018, 96751, '<td valign="top">At first I thought this was a gourd of some sort and couldn''t figure out how that was "country".  Then I thought maybe some OTHER country.  Then I finally figured out that it was the horn of a saddle.  Beautiful saddle abstract, although the blurred elements behind it - especially the one on the far right - are a bit distracting, even if they add depth.</td>', 'At first I thought this was a gourd of some sort and couldn''t figure out how that was "country".  Then I thought maybe some OTHER country.  Then I finally figured out that it was the horn of a saddle.  Beautiful saddle abstract, although the blurred elements behind it - especially the one on the far right - are a bit distracting, even if they add depth.', '2010-09-30 12:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6175785, 911706, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  There is something very rhythmic about this image, the soft diagonal lines of the flower beds and horizon, maybe.</td>', 'Beautiful.  There is something very rhythmic about this image, the soft diagonal lines of the flower beds and horizon, maybe.', '2010-09-30 12:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6175786, 911371, 96751, '<td valign="top">Drat.  I really wish there was more brightness to this image.  It has all the makings of a terrific picture, but I find the lighting dull, and the elements all mushed together, tonally.</td>', 'Drat.  I really wish there was more brightness to this image.  It has all the makings of a terrific picture, but I find the lighting dull, and the elements all mushed together, tonally.', '2010-09-30 12:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6175791, 911465, 96751, '<td valign="top">Fabulous lighting and energy here.  And gorgeous colors.  He seems a bit overbright compared to the surroundings, and oddly white when compared to the colors around him.  I don''t know if that''s part of your processing, or that you don''t let him out of the closet often enough :-)</td>', 'Fabulous lighting and energy here.  And gorgeous colors.  He seems a bit overbright compared to the surroundings, and oddly white when compared to the colors around him.  I don''t know if that''s part of your processing, or that you don''t let him out of the closet often enough :-)', '2010-09-30 12:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6175794, 911747, 96751, '<td valign="top">How cool (or hot) is this!!  Never seen one of these.</td>', 'How cool (or hot) is this!!  Never seen one of these.', '2010-09-30 12:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6175796, 910816, 96751, '<td valign="top">Classic.  I bet this is even better with some sepia (or stronger sepia) in it.</td>', 'Classic.  I bet this is even better with some sepia (or stronger sepia) in it.', '2010-09-30 12:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6175797, 911707, 96751, '<td valign="top">For a title which refers to a specific subject, that subject seems oddly absent or inconspicuous in the image...</td>', 'For a title which refers to a specific subject, that subject seems oddly absent or inconspicuous in the image...', '2010-09-30 12:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6175802, 911089, 96751, '<td valign="top">You know, there are those photographers who will put a naked girl just anywhere :-)<br/> <br/>Just teasing.  This is lovely, although there are a couple of items which don''t really work for me.  Most of them have to do with lines, since the lighting and the pose are terrific.  But the vertical edge of the wall interrupts her curves at the hips and divides the image in half.  And the bg dark wall is likewise overbearing and further helps to divide the image.  I''m wondering why you didn''t just both take a big step backwards.  Oh, and the seat of her pants...  While some might not get past the shape, all I can see is that they''re wet.  Which looks very odd...  Don''t you give your models a potty break?</td>', 'You know, there are those photographers who will put a naked girl just anywhere :-) Just teasing.  This is lovely, although there are a couple of items which don''t really work for me.  Most of them have to do with lines, since the lighting and the pose are terrific.  But the vertical edge of the wall interrupts her curves at the hips and divides the image in half.  And the bg dark wall is likewise overbearing and further helps to divide the image.  I''m wondering why you didn''t just both take a big step backwards.  Oh, and the seat of her pants...  While some might not get past the shape, all I can see is that they''re wet.  Which looks very odd...  Don''t you give your models a potty break?', '2010-09-30 12:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6175804, 911819, 96751, '<td valign="top">Such a noble profile.  Love the detail of the whiskers, and the blur of the tai.</td>', 'Such a noble profile.  Love the detail of the whiskers, and the blur of the tai.', '2010-09-30 12:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6175807, 911310, 96751, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Love your dog in the distance.  He''s all, again??!!  You''re stopping AGAIN???!!</td>', 'LOL!  Love your dog in the distance.  He''s all, again??!!  You''re stopping AGAIN???!!', '2010-09-30 12:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6175808, 911336, 113419, '<td valign="top">Nice B&amp;W image.  Also good encompassing image of work in the country.</td>', 'Nice B&W image.  Also good encompassing image of work in the country.', '2010-09-30 12:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
