(6175812, 911340, 96751, '<td valign="top">I want to do my hair like that but it won''t cooperate.  This just may be the winner.  AWESOME framing, fabulous b/w conversion.  Her face is just incredible.  A real mix of wisdom in her eyes, and an smile that spells trouble with a capital T.  Very relaxed pose too.  Child prodigy model!!!!!!!!!!!1</td>', 'I want to do my hair like that but it won''t cooperate.  This just may be the winner.  AWESOME framing, fabulous b/w conversion.  Her face is just incredible.  A real mix of wisdom in her eyes, and an smile that spells trouble with a capital T.  Very relaxed pose too.  Child prodigy model!!!!!!!!!!!1', '2010-09-30 12:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
