(6175818, 911791, 96751, '<td valign="top">O. M. G.!!!!!!!1  O come on, did you arrange them?  Was Babe your photo assistant???!!! They''re like a vaudeville act waiting in the wings to go on stage. This image is perfection to me.  Certainly front page, and most likely top three.  Brilliant, and I love the progression of the head levels. In addition, the pp is top notch. A most unusual (for the clumped together-ness) and entertaining image. LOVE IT!!!!</td>', 'O. M. G.!!!!!!!1  O come on, did you arrange them?  Was Babe your photo assistant???!!! They''re like a vaudeville act waiting in the wings to go on stage. This image is perfection to me.  Certainly front page, and most likely top three.  Brilliant, and I love the progression of the head levels. In addition, the pp is top notch. A most unusual (for the clumped together-ness) and entertaining image. LOVE IT!!!!', '2010-09-30 12:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6175819, 911809, 96751, '<td valign="top">Are those garlics????????  I love country fairs.</td>', 'Are those garlics????????  I love country fairs.', '2010-09-30 12:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
