(6175945, 911005, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice scene with a lot of potential, but I feel you may have shot it during the wrong time of day and that high overhead sun is not flattering to the scene. The positions of the shadows tells me the sun was high and was backlighting the subject. This resulted in shadows that don''t add anything to the scene and blown highlights in the sky. I find the scene cropped just a touch tight as well. Sorry to be so harsh, but in this case I was able to identify exactly why it didn''t work for me.</td>', 'Nice scene with a lot of potential, but I feel you may have shot it during the wrong time of day and that high overhead sun is not flattering to the scene. The positions of the shadows tells me the sun was high and was backlighting the subject. This resulted in shadows that don''t add anything to the scene and blown highlights in the sky. I find the scene cropped just a touch tight as well. Sorry to be so harsh, but in this case I was able to identify exactly why it didn''t work for me.', '2010-09-30 14:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
