(6175992, 911655, 101702, '<td valign="top">I would have given this an extra point if the horizon had been straight, but it is very wonky which I find a bit off putting. Great symmetry in the reflection though.</td>', 'I would have given this an extra point if the horizon had been straight, but it is very wonky which I find a bit off putting. Great symmetry in the reflection though.', '2010-09-30 14:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6175993, 911781, 101702, '<td valign="top">Lovely balance to this shot and nice compositional lines. An ND grad filter (or a polariser) would help bring some definition into the sky, which is a little washed out, but overall a really nice photo.</td>', 'Lovely balance to this shot and nice compositional lines. An ND grad filter (or a polariser) would help bring some definition into the sky, which is a little washed out, but overall a really nice photo.', '2010-09-30 14:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6176003, 910817, 99263, '<td valign="top">I like the landscape part very much even though it''s quite dark. It''s like a painting by Van Gogh. The only thing I don''t like so much is the sky. It''s too bright for the rest of the scene.</td>', 'I like the landscape part very much even though it''s quite dark. It''s like a painting by Van Gogh. The only thing I don''t like so much is the sky. It''s too bright for the rest of the scene.', '2010-09-30 14:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
