(6177342, 911371, 30364, '<td valign="top">Unusual and very interesting.  Low angle gets the grass stalks in, and the birds, and superimposes the cows onto the dark horizon band so that they are nearly lost.  All sorts of crazy ideas to make a strangely memorable photograph.  That''s good; there are too many forgettable photographs.  Thanks.</td>', 'Unusual and very interesting.  Low angle gets the grass stalks in, and the birds, and superimposes the cows onto the dark horizon band so that they are nearly lost.  All sorts of crazy ideas to make a strangely memorable photograph.  That''s good; there are too many forgettable photographs.  Thanks.', '2010-10-01 15:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6177345, 911018, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is nice.  Right hand quarter confuses me a bit but that''s OK with me.</td>', 'This is nice.  Right hand quarter confuses me a bit but that''s OK with me.', '2010-10-01 15:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6177346, 911614, 30364, '<td valign="top">Very good photograph of a deceptively simple subject.  The angle of the gates is everything here.</td>', 'Very good photograph of a deceptively simple subject.  The angle of the gates is everything here.', '2010-10-01 15:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
