(6178427, 911102, 121916, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of foreground in this.  Natural framing sets this off very well.  Fine tonal values, too.</td>', 'Excellent use of foreground in this.  Natural framing sets this off very well.  Fine tonal values, too.', '2010-10-02 17:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
