(6182607, 911102, 117314, '<td valign="top">Congrats Steve. Nice shot. The border actually kinda adds to the overall appeal of the scene.</td>', 'Congrats Steve. Nice shot. The border actually kinda adds to the overall appeal of the scene.', '2010-10-06 01:19:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(6182618, 911251, 69008, '<td valign="top">That''s a cool looking 65 Econoline.  I would love to have that thing to restore. There were  lots of the vans, but not many of these. <br/>Technically this is a pretty good shot. People would have probably liked it better if the van was off to one side or the other a little, and maybe at a different time of day, to get some long shadows.  Keep shooting good stuff.  <br/> <br/></td>', 'That''s a cool looking 65 Econoline.  I would love to have that thing to restore. There were  lots of the vans, but not many of these. Technically this is a pretty good shot. People would have probably liked it better if the van was off to one side or the other a little, and maybe at a different time of day, to get some long shadows.  Keep shooting good stuff.   ', '2010-10-06 01:23:26.000000', NULL, 0),
