(6182656, 911886, 83313, '<td valign="top">A good mid pack showing though I had expected this to place higher. It was an 8 for me. Great color and details in this.</td>', 'A good mid pack showing though I had expected this to place higher. It was an 8 for me. Great color and details in this.', '2010-10-06 01:51:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(6182658, 911089, 83313, '<td valign="top">Getting easy to identify your entries, I just look for naked women. The wet tush was a nice touch</td>', 'Getting easy to identify your entries, I just look for naked women. The wet tush was a nice touch', '2010-10-06 01:53:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(6182675, 911886, 61084, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Yo_Spiff:</b></div><hr/><i> A good mid pack showing though I had expected this to place higher. It was an 8 for me. Great color and details in this. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks Steve. I was pretty happy with this photo, and honestly I do think it was underscored for some reason. It''s country life and not just country. I wanted to show it what country life really is for many people and that''s mud and all.<br/> <br/>Thanks for the great vote and comments!</td>', 'Originally posted by Yo_Spiff: A good mid pack showing though I had expected this to place higher. It was an 8 for me. Great color and details in this.   Thanks Steve. I was pretty happy with this photo, and honestly I do think it was underscored for some reason. It''s country life and not just country. I wanted to show it what country life really is for many people and that''s mud and all. Thanks for the great vote and comments!', '2010-10-06 02:01:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(6182678, 911102, 12405, '<td valign="top">great job on a 2nd place!</td>', 'great job on a 2nd place!', '2010-10-06 02:03:48.000000', NULL, 0),
