(6182711, 911102, 40391, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get to comment much while voting for this challenge but this is one I really liked (gave 8) so another well deserved ribbon Steve, Congrat''s.</td>', 'I didn''t get to comment much while voting for this challenge but this is one I really liked (gave 8) so another well deserved ribbon Steve, Congrat''s.', '2010-10-06 02:42:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(6182712, 911353, 40391, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites of the challenge (voted 9).  Congratulations on the top 10 finish Fred!</td>', 'One of my favorites of the challenge (voted 9).  Congratulations on the top 10 finish Fred!', '2010-10-06 02:46:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(6182713, 911140, 67258, '<td valign="top">What''s with the 13 votes of 1 and 2? Yes, the photo has some technical issues, most noticeably noise, and compositionally I might have preferred a background thrown a bit more out of focus (curious - you shot this with the 70-200 2.8 - going for a bigger aperture than 5.6 would have allowed you a lower film speed, reduced noise and thrown the background very slightly oof).  But that aside, this screams country life - and is one of the very few in the challenge that does!  The photo is thoroughly interesting, and I thought would up there at least in the top 15.</td>', 'What''s with the 13 votes of 1 and 2? Yes, the photo has some technical issues, most noticeably noise, and compositionally I might have preferred a background thrown a bit more out of focus (curious - you shot this with the 70-200 2.8 - going for a bigger aperture than 5.6 would have allowed you a lower film speed, reduced noise and thrown the background very slightly oof).  But that aside, this screams country life - and is one of the very few in the challenge that does!  The photo is thoroughly interesting, and I thought would up there at least in the top 15.', '2010-10-06 02:48:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(6182716, 911825, 88523, '<td valign="top">Love the photo! (the frame distracts from it IMO)</td>', 'Love the photo! (the frame distracts from it IMO)', '2010-10-06 03:03:15.000000', NULL, 0),
