(6182804, 911012, 117931, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by JopsyDaisy:</b></div><hr/><i> She looks like a princess! Interesting angle and a really cute pony. Is it an Icelandic horse? T </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Yes it is an Icelandic horse :o). Thanks<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-10-06 05:34:58.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by JopsyDaisy: She looks like a princess! Interesting angle and a really cute pony. Is it an Icelandic horse? T  Yes it is an Icelandic horse :o). Thanks', '2010-10-06 06:26:50.000000', '2010-10-06 06:34:58.000000', 0),
