(6182813, 911087, 64568, '<td valign="top">What a stunning image. Congrats on the high finish, shame it just missed out. Love the tones and capture of ''country work'', nice job.</td>', 'What a stunning image. Congrats on the high finish, shame it just missed out. Love the tones and capture of ''country work'', nice job.', '2010-10-06 06:58:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(6182815, 911102, 103142, '<td valign="top">Last time I ask you for advice! You used to be such a good judge of what would or would not do well -- how could you not be sure of this one? Silly Spiff!<br/> <br/>Wonderful shot!! Congrats on the red!</td>', 'Last time I ask you for advice! You used to be such a good judge of what would or would not do well -- how could you not be sure of this one? Silly Spiff! Wonderful shot!! Congrats on the red!', '2010-10-06 07:00:36.000000', NULL, 0),
