(6182928, 911102, 98771, '<td valign="top">Steve, I really like this image.. Congrats on the ribbon, well done!!</td>', 'Steve, I really like this image.. Congrats on the ribbon, well done!!', '2010-10-06 09:24:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(6182933, 911825, 98771, '<td valign="top">Simply Beautiful!! Congrats!</td>', 'Simply Beautiful!! Congrats!', '2010-10-06 09:25:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(6182946, 911073, 97954, '<td valign="top">VERY well done Ron - congratulations!</td>', 'VERY well done Ron - congratulations!', '2010-10-06 09:28:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(6182966, 911102, 58785, '<td valign="top">When I start looking to shoot for this challenge, that was the thing was in my mind... not the trees though (trees are the point-makers here). I couldn''t find anything that I can take photo of, so I took mine asking to the farmer his permission. I don''t know why I feel very nervous if I ask someone''s permission. The farm I took photo of was incredibly awesome if I spent more time. It was a cow farm actually, not a crop farm.<br/> <br/>Congrats on your ribbon, very nice photo :)</td>', 'When I start looking to shoot for this challenge, that was the thing was in my mind... not the trees though (trees are the point-makers here). I couldn''t find anything that I can take photo of, so I took mine asking to the farmer his permission. I don''t know why I feel very nervous if I ask someone''s permission. The farm I took photo of was incredibly awesome if I spent more time. It was a cow farm actually, not a crop farm. Congrats on your ribbon, very nice photo :)', '2010-10-06 09:50:55.000000', NULL, 0),
