(6183269, 911089, 96751, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by fotomann_forever:</b></div><hr/><i> Damn, I go for the whole Daisy Duke look, including putting the model in some cold rain and I get 12 ones... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>No rhyme or reason.  FWIW, it doesn''t look like it was freezing rain.  Quite the opposite.</td>', 'Originally posted by fotomann_forever: Damn, I go for the whole Daisy Duke look, including putting the model in some cold rain and I get 12 ones...   No rhyme or reason.  FWIW, it doesn''t look like it was freezing rain.  Quite the opposite.', '2010-10-06 12:48:18.000000', NULL, 0),
