(6183893, 911787, 121176, '<td valign="top">All,<br/> <br/>Thank you for my messages and especially thanks to Luci11e for the excellent critique.<br/> <br/>One note of relief for everyone, I spoke to an authority on milk cows and was informed she is in perfectly healthy condition. Milk cows are always significantly thinner than those raised for meat.<br/> <br/>I look forward to additional submissions in the future, feel free to comment further :)<br/> <br/>JB</td>', 'All, Thank you for my messages and especially thanks to Luci11e for the excellent critique. One note of relief for everyone, I spoke to an authority on milk cows and was informed she is in perfectly healthy condition. Milk cows are always significantly thinner than those raised for meat. I look forward to additional submissions in the future, feel free to comment further :) JB', '2010-10-06 19:56:35.000000', NULL, 0),
