(6183927, 911340, 24389, '<td valign="top">Thanks tanguera, I agree with most of the comments though, the original picture was overexposed. The girl was playing around with the wheel and I decided to change my aperature from 5.6 to 2.8 and right as I was going to adjust the flash her mom yelled at me to quickly shoot this shot. I''m lucky that I got this shot, I think!</td>', 'Thanks tanguera, I agree with most of the comments though, the original picture was overexposed. The girl was playing around with the wheel and I decided to change my aperature from 5.6 to 2.8 and right as I was going to adjust the flash her mom yelled at me to quickly shoot this shot. I''m lucky that I got this shot, I think!', '2010-10-06 20:24:01.000000', NULL, 0),
